@startuml
!include theme.puml
hide footbox
autonumber
database PostgreSQL as db
participant Relay
queue Kafka
note over db
Hazard + outbox + checkpoint
sudah COMMIT bersama.
end note
Relay -> db : pending ORDER BY id
db --> Relay : snapshot + event ID
Relay -> Kafka : produce\nkey=hazard_id\nacks=all
Kafka --> Relay : ACK
Relay -> db : tandai published_at
note over Relay,Kafka
Crash setelah ACK, sebelum tanda:
event dapat dikirim lagi dengan ID sama.
end note
@enduml
